{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平向日本前首相福田康夫遺屬致唁電。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n福田康夫上星期四逝世，享年90歲。福田康夫生前致力於加強日中關係。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n在北京，外交部昨日回應時表示，中方對福田康夫逝世表示沉痛哀悼，形容他是中國人民的老朋友，為推動中日關係改善發展作出積極貢獻，日本當政者應當深思自省。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:02.358299+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:44.156105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:44.156105+00:00","content_hash":"78d5ce8d3f748282900d0b53c04eb3dc8a7c43898fbea57aa4d5ba738b98a0aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}